# Course Assessments (Quiz) System Implementation Plan

We will implement a comprehensive assessment system that allows instructors to create quizzes for their courses. Passing a final assessment will be a prerequisite for certificate generation.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The assessment system will be integrated as a new `Assessments` module. Each course can have one final quiz that acts as the certification gate.

## Proposed Changes

### [Backend] Assessments Module

#### [NEW] [Quiz](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Quiz.php)
- Stores quiz metadata: `title`, `description`, `passing_score` (percentage), `time_limit` (minutes).
- Relationship: `belongsTo` Course.

#### [NEW] [Question](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Question.php)
- Stores question text and type (`multiple_choice`, `true_false`).
- Relationship: `belongsTo` Quiz.

#### [NEW] [Option](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/Option.php)
- Stores possible answers for each question and an `is_correct` flag.
- Relationship: `belongsTo` Question.

#### [NEW] [QuizAttempt](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Assessments/app/Models/QuizAttempt.php)
- Tracks student attempts: `user_id`, `quiz_id`, `score`, [status](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Lessons/tests/Feature/LessonTest.php#67-83) (`passed`, `failed`).

---

### [Frontend] Instructor & Student UI

#### [NEW] Quiz Creator Interface
- Located within the Course Editor.
- Allows adding/editing questions and setting the passing threshold.

#### [NEW] Quiz Attempt Page
- A premium, timed interface for students to take the assessment.
- Integrated into the Course Player as the final step.

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `php artisan test Modules/Assessments`: Verify quiz creation, submission, and scoring logic.

### Manual Verification
1. Create a quiz as an instructor.
2. Complete all lessons as a student.
3. Take the quiz and verify passing/failing logic.
4. Confirm redirection to certificate generation only after passing.
